                                    About Lots of food revived
This is an unofficial port of the mod 'Lots of Food' by pifou92000 for version 1.21.1.

The Lots of food Mod is a mod that introduces a large number of vanilla-style foods. It adds various food items, crops, and building blocks. These additions closely adhere to the vanilla aesthetic, feature no complex crafting systems, and are both simple and practical.


This mod adds a lot of content, including:

  7 different crops, from which you can obtain seeds by breaking leaves or grass; 

  dozens of vanilla-style foods that are easy to craft and have practical effects; 

  a candy house filled with treasures;

  and a dozen or so building materials, consisting of beautiful decorative blocks made of sugar and chocolate.

                                 Have any suggestions or feedback?

If you have any suggestions, feel free to submit them on GitHub—for example, ideas such as having crops naturally spawn as blocks in the wild instead of requiring seeds to be obtained by breaking grass.
